    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Dear Nimble\r\nTeam,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I&#39;m trying\r\nto truncate an interval to define a random effect:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%\" lang=\"EN-US\">………</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>sigma.alpha ~ dunif(0,10)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>tau.alpha &lt;- pow(sigma2.alpha, -2)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>sigma2.alpha &lt;- pow(sigma.alpha, 2)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>for (i in 1:M){</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>    </span>for(t in 1:T){</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>      </span>ep.alpha[i,t] ~ <span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\">T(dnorm(0,\r\ntau.alpha),-15,15)</span><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>      </span>logit(lam0[i,t])&lt;-mu.alpha[t] +\r\nep.alpha[i,t]</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>    </span>}</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">……………</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">But when I\r\ncompiled, I got:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">defining\r\nmodel...</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">building\r\nmodel...</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">setting\r\ndata and initial values...</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">running\r\ncalculate on model (any error reports that follow may simply reflect missing\r\nvalues in model variables) ... Error in if (-15 &lt;=\r\nmodel$ep.alpha[getNodeFunctionIndexedInfo(INDEXEDNODEINFO_,<span>  </span>: </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><span>  </span>valor ausente donde TRUE/FALSE es necesario #\r\n(sorry, in Spanish…)<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\"><span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">checking\r\nmodel sizes and dimensions... This model is not fully initialized. This is not\r\nan error. To see which variables are not initialized, use\r\nmodel$initializeInfo(). For more information on model initialization, see\r\nhelp(modelInitialization).</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">model\r\nbuilding finished.</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">What’s wrong in the code?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Thank you,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">José</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>"
    ]
