"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">running\r\ncalculate on model (any error reports that follow may simply reflect missing\r\nvalues in model variables) ... Error in if (-15 &lt;=\r\nmodel$ep.alpha[getNodeFunctionIndexedInfo(INDEXEDNODEINFO_,<span>  </span>: </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><span>  </span>valor ausente donde TRUE/FALSE es necesario #\r\n(sorry, in Spanish…)<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,0)\"><span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">checking\r\nmodel sizes and dimensions... This model is not fully initialized. This is not\r\nan error. To see which variables are not initialized, use\r\nmodel$initializeInfo(). For more information on model initialization, see\r\nhelp(modelInitialization).</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"EN-US\">model\r\nbuilding finished.</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">What’s wrong in the code?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Thank you,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">José</span></p><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n</font></span></div></blockquote></div></div></div></div>"
