\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">      logit(lam0[i,t])&lt;-mu.alpha[t] + ep.alpha[i,t]</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">    }</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">……………</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">But when I compiled, I got:</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">defining model...</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">building model...</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">setting data and initial values...</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">running calculate on model (any error reports that follow may simply reflect missing values in model variables)\r\n ... Error in if (-15 &lt;= model$ep.alpha[getNodeFunctionIndexedInfo(INDEXEDNODEINFO_,  :\r\n</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">  valor ausente donde TRUE/FALSE es necesario # (sorry, in Spanish…)</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"> </span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">checking model sizes and dimensions... This model is not 